Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the battlefield, among the wounded who could have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}been saved, the leading cause of death is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hemorrhagic shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Shock from bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:10.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That's how one Army regimental surgeon puts it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 974 0 l 974 132 l 0 132{\p0}
