Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOHENFELS, GERMANY · MAY 20, 2025 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SIMULATED CASUALTY · COMBINED RESOLVE 25-2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The answer is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But blood has to be kept cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It has to be the right type.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And far from a hospital, it runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:20.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So the military went back to an old idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If you can't carry enough blood, bring the donors.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.59,0:00:23.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 974 0 l 974 132 l 0 132{\p0}
