Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.59,0:00:23.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WALKING BLOOD BANK CLASS · KERIS STRIKE 26
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On a remote island in the Indian Ocean, volunteers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}are screened ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If someone is badly hurt, the blood bank is already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}on the base, walking around.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.60,0:00:29.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 918 0 l 918 132 l 0 132{\p0}
