Dialogue: 3,0:00:23.60,0:00:29.35,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WALKING BLOOD BANK SCREENING DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:55.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Whole blood is all of it, together, in one bag.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
