Dialogue: 3,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.67,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LOW TITER O WHOLE BLOOD · ASBB CENTER OKINAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But most transfusions don't use it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Donated blood is more often given as its separate parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Red cells. Plasma. Platelets.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.97,0:01:01.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:55.97,0:01:01.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:55.97,0:01:01.72,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}NORFOLK, VA. · MAY 2022 · DEFENSE HEALTH AGENCY
Dialogue: 3,0:00:55.97,0:01:01.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMED SERVICES BLOOD PROGRAM DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And there's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood comes in types.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The clumping comes from antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An Army blood bank director put it simply.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.62,0:01:32.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.62,0:01:32.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.62,0:01:32.08,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}KELLEY BARRACKS, GERMANY · MAY 2023 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.62,0:01:32.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMED SERVICES BLOOD PROGRAM DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Type O red cells are already considered universal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:46.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But type O donors can carry antibodies against type
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A and type B blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:50.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So the military tests type O donors, and keeps the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}ones whose levels are low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1945, an Army film showed whole blood from the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:31.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}home front, reaching soldiers overseas.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.75,0:03:30.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1081 0 l 1081 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.75,0:03:30.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.75,0:03:30.50,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY · "GI'S GET WHOLE BLOOD FROM HOME FRONT"
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.75,0:03:30.50,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · "COMBAT BULLETIN NO. 35"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then came Korea, and the lesson had to be learned again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When the war began, the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}had no operational military blood program.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The first blood shipments didn't arrive until more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}than two months into combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Long supply lines and the short shelf life of whole
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood led to significant waste, and drove innovation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in plastic blood bags, and longer red cell storage.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.86,0:03:37.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
