Dialogue: 3,0:03:31.86,0:03:37.61,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}"BLOOD BANK STORY, TOKYO, JAPAN" · NATIONAL ARCHIVES
Dialogue: 3,0:03:31.86,0:03:37.61,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · DEC. 1950 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:56.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This Army film from December 1950 shows the Army's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood bank storage and shipment office in Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}during the Korean War.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:40.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the 1970s, the Army moved to what's called
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:41.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}component therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Civilian medicine made the same move in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}seventies and eighties.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.97,0:04:43.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
