Dialogue: 3,0:04:37.97,0:04:43.72,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}KADENA AIR BASE, JAPAN · SEPT. 2022 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:04:37.97,0:04:43.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BLOOD LAB · ASBB CENTER OKINAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And for a medic far from a hospital, components had
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Plasma has to be kept frozen, and platelets bring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}their own logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:17.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An Army surgeon said components are not a feasible
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}option for an immediate need for blood in the field.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.66,0:05:12.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1167 0 l 1167 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:06.66,0:05:12.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
