Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:43.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}According to the review, the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}military re-adopted fresh whole blood from walking
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood banks in 2002.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.05,0:05:46.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
