Dialogue: 3,0:05:41.05,0:05:46.80,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. CENTRAL COMMAND AREA · 2025 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:05:41.05,0:05:46.80,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WALKING BLOOD BANK TRAINING · 368TH FIELD HOSPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:51.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A walking blood bank is, first of all, a list of names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Volunteers are tested ahead of time, for blood type,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}for antibody levels, and for diseases that can be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}passed on by transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They're regularly retested for blood-borne diseases.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.58,0:05:54.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1081 0 l 1081 132 l 0 132{\p0}
