Dialogue: 3,0:05:48.58,0:05:54.33,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP LEJEUNE, N.C. · FEB. 25, 2026 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:05:48.58,0:05:54.33,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOINT TRAUMA SYSTEM VALKYRIE TRANSFUSION COURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A Navy surgeon explained why that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:16.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Stored blood may need warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:19.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Fresh blood, he said, is already in our bodies, at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}98.6 degrees.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.74,0:06:17.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
