Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.74,0:06:17.49,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}1ST MEDICAL BATTALION · CAMP PENDLETON · MARCH 27, 2024
Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.74,0:06:17.49,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}EMERGENCY FRESH WHOLE BLOOD TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:24.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Valkyrie training, the Marine Corps says, blood
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}drawn from a volunteer goes back into that same volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In May 2015, the first Ranger donors were prescreened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Months later, Rangers deployed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And in March 2016, the first shipment of stored low
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}titer O whole blood left Joint Base Lewis-McChord,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in Washington State, for Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.33,0:07:04.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 918 0 l 918 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:58.33,0:07:04.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:58.33,0:07:04.08,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ASBP DRIVE, NORFOLK, VA. · ASBB CENTER OKINAWA · 2022
Dialogue: 3,0:06:58.33,0:07:04.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STORED WHOLE BLOOD · ILLUSTRATIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:28.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2017, the program won one of the Army's Greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Innovation Awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That same year, a Navy surgeon, Lieutenant Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Russell Wier, developed a version for corpsmen and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Marines, inspired by the Rangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's called Valkyrie.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.45,0:07:31.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1317 0 l 1317 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:25.45,0:07:31.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:25.45,0:07:31.20,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ROBERTSON BARRACKS, DARWIN · MAY 2024 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:07:25.45,0:07:31.20,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VALKYRIE FRESH WHOLE BLOOD TRAINING · WITH AUSTRALIAN ARMY
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2026, a Marine Corps unit hosted a Joint Trauma
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}System version of the course, which the Marine Corps
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:50.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}says implements a new Defense Department-wide
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.31,0:07:53.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}standard for fresh whole blood transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:55.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The five-day course runs from managing donor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}rosters, to performing transfusions.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.95,0:07:46.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:40.95,0:07:46.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:40.95,0:07:46.70,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP LEJEUNE, N.C. · FEB. 2026 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:07:40.95,0:07:46.70,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JTS VALKYRIE PREHOSPITAL TRANSFUSION COURSE · 2ND MLG
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And stored low titer O whole blood came back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:04.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Rangers' first shipment went out in 2016.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The review dates the military's reintroduction of it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:08.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}to 2017.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood centers collect it from prescreened donors,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}refrigerate it, and ship it forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By one Army Blood Program count, more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}thousand units had gone to U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Central Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:23.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army Blood Program's director noted it can be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}kept in a standard refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And for teams close to the front, the program said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a unit of whole blood is often their only source of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}platelets.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.04,0:08:04.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:59.04,0:08:04.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:59.04,0:08:04.79,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ASBB CENTER OKINAWA · KADENA AIR BASE · SEPT. 2022 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:07:59.04,0:08:04.79,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}COLLECTING LOW TITER O WHOLE BLOOD
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Why so much effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A Navy lab chief put it in one sentence.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.23,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}NORFOLK, VA. · MAY 2022 · DEFENSE HEALTH AGENCY
Dialogue: 3,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.23,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BLOOD STORAGE · ASBP BLOOD DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Whole blood isn't the answer to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The review describes it as a first treatment for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}life-threatening bleeding, with a possible switch to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:35.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}type-specific components once the bleeding is under
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:38.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}control, the patient is stable, or supplies run low.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.80,0:09:29.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.80,0:09:29.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.80,0:09:29.55,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}NORFOLK, VA. · MAY 2022 · DEFENSE HEALTH AGENCY
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.80,0:09:29.55,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BLOOD STORAGE · ASBP BLOOD DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And it has a limit no lab has solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:42.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood can't be manufactured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:46.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every unit, whole or in parts, starts with a donor.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.82,0:09:44.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:38.82,0:09:44.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:38.82,0:09:44.57,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}KELLEY BARRACKS, GERMANY · MAY 2023 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:09:38.82,0:09:44.57,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMED SERVICES BLOOD PROGRAM DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Robertson's ice chest became a list of names.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}People who agree, ahead of time, to give blood to a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stranger on the worst day of that stranger's life.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.11,0:10:08.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:03.11,0:10:08.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
